~ Intro
Two nights ago, a wounded woman arrived in your village.
Only the magic of the Wadan could save her.
You volunteered to take her into the southern desert mountains...
where the last Wadan were seen forty years ago.
=> END


~ Oasis
Player: Here. Drink slowly.
Woman: How much farther?
Player: The mountains are still a day's journey away.
Woman: Then we should fill everything we have.
Player: You sound like you've been here before.
Woman: A long time ago.
=> END